<item>
<title>Unlock All Championship Cups</title>
<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=14930</link>
<description>Took an initial memory dump.  Unlocked Silver Championship Cup by coming first overall in Bronze Championship Cup.  Saved to memory card.  Kept switching between game with Silver unlocked and just Bronze unlocked, changing the value to be less than or greater than 1.  Completed Silver Championship Cup to unlock Gold Chamionship Cup.  Searched for greater than 1.  Narrowed down to just 2 possibilities.  First one was the right one.  Setting to 0x03 unlocks all Championship Cups.</description>
<author>Xploder &lt;support@xploder.net&gt;</author>
<category>cheats</category>
<guid>http://xs.xploder.net/cheat/631429</guid>
<pubDate>26 Jun 2003 12:53:00 GMT</pubDate>
<xpl:cheatid>631429</xpl:cheatid>
<xpl:order>10</xpl:order>
<xpl:availability>Available</xpl:availability>
</item>
<item>
<title>Unlock Hovercraft Bonus Vehicle</title>
<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=14930</link>
<description>Noticed that number of 'Bonus Icons' was the same value as the number of Championship Cups I had unlocked.  There was one extra one, which obviously meant when the last one had been completed.  Added one to it and I was able to turn the option for the bonus cars on.</description>
<author>Xploder &lt;support@xploder.net&gt;</author>
